Initial stock = 12.

We also need to compute lost quantity from demands where demand > current stock. For each demand event, compute min(stock, quantity). Subtract that amount from stock. If quantity > stock, then lost = quantity - stock. Add lost to historical_lost. If quantity <= stock, lost = 0. Also stockout occurs if lost > 0.

